        <!-- The mod -->
        <Row Tag="LOC_LSHUF_MOD_NAME"><Text>Re-dealable Leader Abilities, Attributes, and Start Biases</Text></Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_LSHUF_MOD_DESCRIPTION"><Text>Shuffles leader abilities, attributes and start terrain at the start of a game. Leaders can swap abilities, swap everything, or have the separate bonuses inside each ability mixed between them, and you can turn abilities, attributes or start terrain off for everyone. It works in multiplayer through the game's own lobby, and the game's leader screens show what each leader ended up with, including where they like to start.</Text></Row>

